2734
02:36:06,611 --> 02:36:07,091
2T.

2735
02:36:07,611 --> 02:36:08,491
Karesini aldım.

2736
02:36:09,611 --> 02:36:10,291
4T kare.

2737
02:36:11,611 --> 02:36:13,371
Sonra Y'nin türevini al diyor.

2738
02:36:14,051 --> 02:36:15,531
